│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ tie_mixers_reduce_params                                                                  │
│ patch_description        │ The previous candidate dramatically increased accuracy and expressivity by introducing a  │
│                          │ mid-circuit mixer that breaks the commutativity of the full 28-CZ complete graph,         │
│                          │ splitting it into a 16-edge half and a 12-edge half. However, it introduced two new       │
│                          │ parameters per block (`mid_ry` and `mid_rx`), bringing the total parameter count to 38    │
│                          │ and limiting the parameter efficiency score.                                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ We can improve the parameter efficiency by tying the parameters of the mid-circuit mixer  │
│                          │ to those of the input mixer (`collective_ry` -> `mix_ry`, `collective_rx_in` -> `mix_rx`, │
│                          │ etc.). Applying the same rotational unitary twice (interleaved by different non-commuting │
│                          │ diagonal CZ layers) still perfectly breaks commutativity and provides deep state          │
│                          │ evolution, but it halves the parameters needed for the mixing layers. We also rename the  │
│                          │ output parameters for consistency (`out_rz`, `out_rx`).                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This reduces the block parameters from 6 to 4, dropping total parameters from 38 to 26,   │
│                          │ which significantly boosts the parameter efficiency metric while preserving the exact     │
│                          │ same powerful entangling structure and depth.                                             │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.3215                                                                                   │
