│ patch_description        │ Replace the single shared output RX layer with a shared X-Y-X Euler mixer. The three      │
│                          │ noncommuting collective angles preserve permutation symmetry and parameter sharing while  │
│                          │ giving every independent ansatz block a full SU(2) readout basis. This should convert a   │
│                          │ broader range of phase correlations into mean-Z populations, improving classification     │
│                          │ boundaries and L2 loss without adding entangling depth. The ansatz uses six parameters    │
│                          │ per block and 38 total parameters, remaining compact.                                     │
