                         Patch Metadata - Gen 46/50 - Novelty: 1/2 - Resample: 1/3 - Patch: 2/2                         
╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ alternating_axis_shared_mid_3stage                                                        │
│ patch_description        │ Replace the current 6-param/block design (two separate mid-mixer params ry_mid1, rx_mid2) │
│                          │ with a 5-param/block design that uses a single shared "mid" parameter applied as RY at    │
│                          │ the first CZ break and RX at the second CZ break. This:                                   │
│                          │ 1. Reduces params from 38 to 32 (matching the best design), improving regularization and  │
│                          │ parameter efficiency                                                                      │
│                          │ 2. Maintains 3-stage CZ entanglement (12+8+8 edges) for richer circuit structure          │
│                          │ 3. Alternates between Y-axis and X-axis mid-mixers for maximal non-commutativity with the │
│                          │ diagonal CZ layers                                                                        │
│                          │ 4. Keeps same gate count (540) as the best design                                         │
│                          │ The alternating single-axis approach is more parameter-efficient than dual-axis           │
│                          │ mid-mixers while still breaking CZ commutation at two circuit points.                     │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $1.0155                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
